DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       rrllaattooppaamm converts an Alias RLA (run-length encoded type A) or RPF (rich
       pixel  format)  image  to a PAM image file.  The output PAM file can be
       grayscale or RGB, with or without a transparency channel.

       _r_l_a_f_i_l_e is the file name of the input file.  If you omit  this  parame‐
       ter, rrllaattooppaamm reads the image from Standard Input.

       There is no program in Netpbm that converts the other direction.x


